Structuré autour de trois pôles - Business Consulting, Data,&nbsp;Technology&nbsp;&amp; Digital - le cabinet intervient de bout en bout, de la vision à l’exécution, avec une forte conviction : la performance passe par une expérience client réinventée, portée par la data et l’IA. &nbsp;

OPSWAT , a global leader in IT, OT , and ICS critical infrastructure cybersecurity, delivers an end-to-end platform that gives public and private sector organizations and enterprises the critical advantage needed to protect their complex networks, secure their devices, and ensure compliance. Over the last 20 years our commitment to innovative technology has earned the trust of more than 1,700 organizations, governments, and institutions globally, solidifying our role in protecting the world’s critical infrastructure and securing our way of life.

&nbsp;

A personal note from Andreea, Global Head of HR

I'm Andreea, Global Head of HR at OPSWAT.&nbsp;OPSWAT is also the kind of place where opportunities tend to find the people willing to take them on. Things move fast, there’s always something new to figure out, and you get a lot of space to make an impact.&nbsp;For me, HR works best when it can move at the pace of the business - close enough to understand what’s really going on and quick enough to make a difference.&nbsp;I don’t see that as a formula, though. I’d love to shape what it looks like together with someone who shares that mindset, but who will also bring their own perspective and challenge my thinking along the way. If this sounds like the kind of team and environment you’d enjoy being part of, I’d really love to hear from you.

